WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,640 --> 00:00:01,840
Yes, it's a boat

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:04,200
I remember when your uncle bought this fish boat

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,080
As long as you go to sea, you can always come back with a full load

4
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:07,160
Relying on money from selling fish

5
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:10,560
He built that courtyard of houses, right? Think about it for yourself

6
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:12,760
Did Jianguo get lucky after he got on that boat?

7
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:14,160
Donkeys get rich by beating them

8
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,440
If you dare, before Zhang Jianguo is willing to go to sea,

9
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:17,800
Buy their boat

10
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:18,920
Get the black eagle now

11
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:20,360
The deepest part of the sea is our home.

12
00:00:21,850 --> 00:00:23,170
It's all my fault that I was greedy

13
00:00:23,170 --> 00:00:25,010
I just want to have sex with that dad for free

14
00:00:25,010 --> 00:00:27,050
Otherwise, let’s go talk to Zhang Jianguo now

15
00:00:27,370 --> 00:00:29,090
Now he has to go to sea every day

16
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:30,690
How is it possible to sell the boat to us?

17
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:33,330
How do you know if you don't ask? Besides, we just spend money to buy it.

18
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:35,410
It's not like last time to grab it, right?

19
00:00:35,410 --> 00:00:40,220
It’s not like I borrowed a bank loan like last time, right?

20
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:41,500
Then I'll look for a chance

21
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:43,140
Find someone to talk to you about

22
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:45,420
That kid went crazy and refused to recognize his relatives

23
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:53,450
Better be careful

24
00:00:53,450 --> 00:00:55,170
The total cost of selling goods is only a few hundred yuan.

25
00:00:55,790 --> 00:00:57,670
These are the things your boy bought today

26
00:00:57,670 --> 00:00:58,990
At least fifty yuan

27
00:00:58,990 --> 00:01:05,170
How much is it? You should listen today

28
00:01:05,170 --> 00:01:06,690
You brat's sweet words

29
00:01:06,690 --> 00:01:08,650
Let you keep the money yourself, mother, don't fight

30
00:01:08,650 --> 00:01:09,850
I didn't spend money randomly

31
00:01:09,850 --> 00:01:13,580
what's going on
